cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EvalDelta, please cite it as below. Cite the source datasets listed in docs/BENCHMARK_CARD.md separately."
type: software
title: "EvalDelta: Budget-Constrained Paired Regression Testing for ML Model Versions"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-24
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/mishra-avdhesh/EvalDelta"
abstract: "Statistically controlled regression testing that compares an old and a new model version on the same items under a fixed evaluation budget, keeping item selection separate from the data used for the decision."
keywords:
  - regression testing
  - model evaluation
  - sequential testing
  - MLOps
